      "order": 16,
      "block_id": "2d533a35-f506-48a2-80f7-9f5a15922c67",
      "source_hash": "1842514190b2d6f885136a0dca02389e1530e3eccc8a946800ea86b4d2456774",
      "markdown": "[판본 캐시 계약](library-file:fde1_bGliZmlsZV96OUVYRUNhVFJxbDJGRFl0NFExeDF3_FileDrive_73e3d24e44d881918a9b9622fd5a4193)은 [학원 실무 거버넌스](page:page_7058921f1a988191a136a172c81a2487)에서 관리합니다.",
      "interpretation": "source_snapshot_not_new_teacher_verdict"
