      "source_hash": "c338798ac45b7e9f1aa8dab0c629deaa663cceab22fe5a11d4d4431255a6416f",
      "markdown": "## 전체 판본 색인",
      "interpretation": "source_snapshot_not_new_teacher_verdict"
    },
    {
